{"quest":{"line_id":"16010514","line_type":"5","order":853,"title":{"cn":"新闻现状","en":"State of the News","jp":"ニュースの現状","kr":"뉴스의 현실"},"description":{"cn":"邪恶生物原来只是一只小羊……真希望秘闻社以后的报道能够更符合事实一些。","en":"The evil creature turned out to be a lamb... Maybe the newspaper can try reporting the facts next time.","jp":"邪悪な生き物の正体は、ただの子羊だった……今後の秘密新聞社の報道が、もう少し事実に即したものであることを願うばかりだ。","kr":"사악한 생물의 정체는 그저 어린 양이었다... 시크릿 신문사가 앞으로는 좀 더 사실에 기반한 기사를 써주길 바란다."},"reputation_camp_id":"602","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"莱希拉姆魔法学校","en":"Serene Lyceum","jp":"レヒラム魔法学院","kr":"라이세움 마법 아카데미"},"route":"#/season-6/daily/16010514","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010514:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233260"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233270"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010514:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233280"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010514:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233300"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233310"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010514:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233320"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010514:1:5"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_16010514:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233330"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_16010514:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16233340"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与佐尔娅对话","en":"Talk to Zorya","jp":"ザレリヤと話す","kr":"조르아와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"闲来无事，去看看佐尔娅老师那里有没有什么需要帮忙的吧。","en":"Since you're free for now, go see if Zorya needs help with anything.","jp":"時間ができたので、ザレリヤに何か手伝えることがないか聞いてみよう。","kr":"한가한 김에 조르아 쪽에 도움이 필요한 일이 있는지 확인해 보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"查看公告板","en":"Check the Board","jp":"掲示板を確認する","kr":"게시판 보기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"不知道秘闻社的外包记者们又写出了什么夸张的报道。查看公告板上的报道内容。","en":"No idea what exaggerated story the freelance reporters wrote this time. Check the bulletin board and read it.","jp":"秘密新聞社がまた誇張した報道をしているかもしれない。掲示板の記事を確認しよう。","kr":"시크릿 신문사의 외주 기자들이 또 어떤 과장된 기사를 썼는지 모르겠다. 게시판의 보도를 확인하자."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"前往求知魔法村","en":"Go to Lumivale","jp":"ナレッジ村へ向かう","kr":"지식의 마을로 이동하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"根据报道内容，前往求知魔法村寻找农户与他的邪恶生物。","en":"Go to Lumivale and find the farmer and his evil creature mentioned in the news report.","jp":"記事の内容を手がかりに、ナレッジ村へ向かい、農夫と「邪悪な生き物」を探しに行こう。","kr":"보도에 나온 농가와 사악한 생물을 찾기 위해 지식의 마을로 가자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"采集青草","en":"Gather Fresh Grass","jp":"青草を採集する","kr":"싱싱한 풀 채집하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"为农户家的小羊采集一些青草。","en":"Gather fresh grass for the farmer's lamb.","jp":"農夫の子羊のために、いくらか青草を摘んで帰ってあげよう。","kr":"양을 위해 싱싱한 풀을 채집하자."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"将青草交给农户","en":"Deliver the Grass","jp":"青草を農夫に渡す","kr":"싱싱한 풀을 농부에게 전하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"将采集好的青草交给农户。","en":"Give the grass you gathered to the farmer.","jp":"集めた青草を農夫のもとへ届けよう。","kr":"채집한 싱싱한 풀을 농부에게 전하자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与佐尔娅对话","en":"Talk to Zorya","jp":"ザレリヤと話す","kr":"조르아와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"事情解决了。回去将这个好消息告诉佐尔娅吧。","en":"Everything is taken care of. Go back and tell Zorya the good news.","jp":"問題は解決した。この朗報をザレリヤに伝えに戻ろう。","kr":"일이 해결되었다. 이 소식을 조르아에게 전하러 가자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"16233260","asset":"ep6/quest_story_16233260","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep6/quest_story_16233260.asset","raw_sha256":"b6955bf63140896a381f2b6f0e3e717b2fa02559aaad30a0932ac5fcdf25991a","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":30852960,"size":2032,"identity":"16010514:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"16233270","asset":"ep6/quest_story_16233270","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep6/quest_story_16233270.asset","raw_sha256":"23